      "name": "About Strip",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Chennai’s finest sweets, now delivered across India!",
        "description": "<p>Our path echoes a gentle rise, starting with a delectable variety of sweets and hot panniyaram in our first Arumbakkam outlet. Now with 20+ outlets that honour time-tested recipes across Chennai Kanchipuram and Tiruvallur we remain grounded. Using old recipes for ghee-rich treats and crisp bites that make life feel festive. Nithya Amirtham promises quiet care, superior quality and warmth for all.</p>",
